# MBTA Trail Game Design Document
Version 1.0

## Game Overview
Genre: Survival Strategy
Target Audience:
* Fans of Oregon Trail
* Bostonians
* Casual strategy players
* Retro game fans

Core Fantasy: Survive the unpredictable Boston commute while managing limited resources and making it safely to the final destination.

Design Pillars:
* Simple to learn
* Funny inside jokes
* Every playthrough tells a different story
* Easy to expand with new content (additional routes, lines)

## Core Gameplay Loop
The player repeatedly performs these actions:
Choose character
    ↓
Start Journey
    ↓
Choose Action
    ↓
Gain or lose resources
    ↓
Random Event
    ↓
Next Station
    ↓
Repeat
    ↓
Reach Park Street

